{"sections":[{"id":"h.21zlxl6caqpf","title":"Voice in the Sea","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-186808","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu hoàn t","italic":true},{"text":"hành ","italic":true},{"text":"Shadows of War Finale","italic":true},{"text":" để mở","italic":true},{"text":" khoá Storyline này.","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-186876","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Hub Town:","bold":true},{"text":" The Gods and Greater Beings of the Old Worlds Order have revealed their task to neutralize three dire threats before they awaken ("},{"text":"/join terminatemple","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/termina-temple"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187040","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Varga's guidance leads you to the fishing village of Ashray, where secrets old and new will be revealed ("},{"text":"/join ashray","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ashray"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187170","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" Queen Victoria's underwater research lab is safe and staffed by scientists and clerics to advance medical and defensive technology ("},{"text":"/join sunlightzone","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/sunlight-zone"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187334","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" Explore the Twilight Zone of Seabase Undine to uncover old friends, new secrets, and potentially find the information you seek in a dark sea ("},{"text":"/join twilightzone","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/twilight-zone"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187509","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV:","bold":true},{"text":" The threat grows more deadly and the plot more dire. Steel yourself for what lies ahead... In the darkness... below the waves... Where no one can hear you scream ("},{"text":"/join midnightzone","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/midnight-zone"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187704","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V:","bold":true},{"text":" Fight to stay sane as the darkness grows deeper and waves of dread wash over you... ("},{"text":"/join abyssalzone","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/abyssal-zone"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-187819","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VI:","bold":true},{"text":" As you battle to save those you hold dear... and survive with your mind intact... you'll need to decide what -- and who -- matter most to you, and how much you'll give away to keep them safe ("},{"text":"/join trenchobserve","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/trench-observation-deck"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188044","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VII:","bold":true},{"text":" You must stop Neso, the Avatar of Water, from subsuming Lore into the Plane of Water. Survive, and silence the Voice in the Sea... forever! ("},{"text":"/join seavoice","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/the-voice-in-the-sea"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188214","runs":[{"text":"→ Return to "},{"text":"/join terminatemple","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/termina-temple"},{"text":". Talk to Tara for “"},{"text":"Mopping Up","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/tara-s-quests#Epilogue"},{"text":"” quest, watch the epilogue cutscene.\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188313","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Epilogue:","bold":true},{"text":" The Voice in the Sea has been silenced, and the dangerous implications for our world cannot be denied any longer ("},{"text":"/join kathooldepths","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/god-of-the-depths-bonus-zone"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188462","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Hub Town","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WkFudi3dKaU"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zc3UMpzsHOU"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y58XJNI7XxA"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MkVBWONCGcQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ePBkGKf47PI"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 5","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZYSwlkr7wzE"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 6","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KLozZR-v1mE"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 7","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iQK-EmfbhBE"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.6n8106327c9b","title":"Rumbling of Cold Thunder","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188586","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu hoàn t","italic":true},{"text":"hành ","italic":true},{"text":"Voice in the Sea","italic":true},{"text":" để m","italic":true},{"text":"ở khoá Storyline này.","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188649","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" You and Tara confront Queen Victoria about the horrors of Seabase Undine as the storm clouds of war and betrayal roll in... ("},{"text":"/join balmorale","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/balemorale-castle"},{"text":")"},{"text":".\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-188802","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" They say the Skye's the limit... unless you refuse to acknowledge them. But NO ONE could refuse the attention of Queen Iona Lothian, descendant of the original Champion of Energ"},{"text":"y ("},{"text":"/join castleeblana","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/castle-eblana"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-189014","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" The flames of war have ignited the shores of Skye, and Galanoth needs your help to defend and protect the rebels being ravaged in the Ruins of Loughshine ("},{"text":"/join loughshine","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ruins-of-loughshine"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-189200","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV:","bold":true},{"text":" Queen Iona's weaponized lightning rains down relentlessly, driving you forward, but their strikes might just shine a light on the dark secret that will bring down her dynasty ("},{"text":"/join naoisegrave","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/naoise-s-grave"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-189407","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V:","bold":true},{"text":" The situation is dire, with an army of undead rising from Greenguard wreckage and an enraged Tyrant Queen wielding elemental magic. Iona is waiting, and if you and your allies survive, you'll need to fight harder ("},{"text":"/join liatarahill","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/the-hill-of-lia-tara"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-189651","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VI:","bold":true},{"text":" Assume the throne of Skye and depose Queen Iona as your objective. Gaining the upper hand is almost certain, but first you must confront the true warlord and learn about Cold Thunder's beginnings ("},{"text":"/join castlegaheris","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/castle-gaheris"},{"text":")"},{"text":".\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-189881","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VII:","bold":true},{"text":" The Avatar of Energy has fallen, and the Avatar of Cold Thunder rises, causing Iona's storms to rage until Lore becomes a frozen, lightning-scarred waste ("},{"text":"/join coldthunder","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/cold-thunder"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190068","runs":[{"text":"→ Return to "},{"text":"/join terminatemple","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/termina-temple"},{"text":". Talk to Tara for “"},{"text":"Tell-Tale Heart","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/tara-s-quests#CTEpilogue"},{"text":"” quest, watch the epilogue cutscene.\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190173","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aDgZidooQ98"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M4pPRISxNp0&pp=ygUQY2FzdGxlZWJsYW5hIGFxdw%3D%3D"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QPzptH3sxk&pp=ygUQY2FzdGxlZWJsYW5hIGFxdw%3D%3D"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajV95Yh73L8"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 5","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCQrz8OCFFo"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 6","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UPh0BhVsdNU"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 7","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8YeYOA4vxQ0"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.i4cy60pg7eq9","title":"Flame of the Beyond","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190281","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu ho","italic":true},{"text":"àn thành ","italic":true},{"text":"Rumbling of Cold Thunder","italic":true},{"text":" để mở kh","italic":true},{"text":"oá Storyline này.","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190352","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Thelima’s forges burn day and night, but something hungrier than its sacred flames is lurking in the dark. Waiting for a spark to set it free. And if it spreads... nothing will surv"},{"text":"ive ("},{"text":"/join thelimacity","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/thelima-city"},{"text":")"},{"text":".\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190568","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" The First Champion of Fire has risen ... but so has his eternal enemy, the Flame of the Beyond! It threatens to ignite an endless inferno. Strike fast to dispel this dark threat ("},{"text":"/join mountmaleno","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/mount-maleno"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190778","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" The Flame in Mount Maleno has spread to Albedo, forcing Warlic to split the party and cast you into Aiwass Sanctuary, where you must survive alone ("},{"text":"/join sanctuaryaiwass","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/sanctuary-aiwass"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-190962","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV:","bold":true},{"text":" Forge Albedo is a nightmare of steel and fire, where Warlic is slipping away from the mage. Battle to separate truth from deception, as lies threaten to consume everything ("},{"text":"/join forgealbedo","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/forge-albedo"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-191166","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V:","bold":true},{"text":" The Flame of Enlightenment in Fort Luma reveals the true intentions of former allies and poses a danger to innocent people amidst a sinister ritual. Immediate action is required as the situation could escalate beyond control ("},{"text":"/join fortluma","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fort-luma"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-191419","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VI:","bold":true},{"text":" The hallowed fires of the Magnum Opus Forges have burnt for ages, but never in this manner. Go protect Warlic from himself... And discover the true nature of Fire ("},{"text":"/join warwickforest","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/warwickforest-shop"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-191616","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VII:","bold":true},{"text":" Face Aleister, Warlic's long-long brother and your former friend... And a champion that could incinerate the universe ("},{"text":"/join magnumopus","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/magnum-opus"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-191766","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Epilogue:","bold":true},{"text":" The shutdown has begun, and while chaos ensues, Tara and Warlic take a stand to protect you from despair. Appreciate their sacrifice and don't waste their effort ("},{"text":"/join rubedopeak","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/rubedo-peak"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"/join flameusurper","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/flame-usurper"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-191982","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6A1wU4wkhIY"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4Id7dR3qsk"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b8bOTgXuZOg"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTljg_2-4TM"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 5","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wSQrpdXEdgY"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 6","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kKN6cX8aj14"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 7 & Epilogue","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U41paYI5WXg"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.mmsmlnot4yzh","title":"The Last Sunset","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192097","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu hoàn th","italic":true},{"text":"ành ","italic":true},{"text":"Shadows Rising","italic":true},{"text":" để m","italic":true},{"text":"ở khoá Storyline này.","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192158","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" The Eternal Eclipse War has concluded, with the Mysterious Stranger now identified as you, the new leader of the Army of DOOM. Your mission is to defeat The Law, with the path to them located within the Temple of Doom ("},{"text":"/join templeofdoom","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/temple-of-doom"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192409","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GPreFVQRYrY"},{"text":" - \n"}]}]}],"next":{"title":"Darkon's Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/darkon-s-saga"},"missingImageCount":5}